WEBVTT
NOTE 字幕时间轴按各句字符数占比在实测总时长上分配（合成语速恒定）；未做逐句人工对齐校正。

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.893
Part one, what it is.

2
00:00:01.893 --> 00:00:16.318
In 1909, Zhan Tianyou designed the "人字形" switchback on the Jing-Zhang Railway: a train gained climbing capacity through a reversing path, with no new equipment.

3
00:00:16.318 --> 00:00:23.260
This proposal translates the switchback into an urban AI governance contract.

4
00:00:23.260 --> 00:00:37.415
Before any intelligent capability moves forward on the belt, it must register a forward state, a switchback path, residual traces and an acceptance decision.

5
00:00:37.415 --> 00:00:40.209
Evolution presupposes rollback.

6
00:00:40.209 --> 00:00:42.373
Part two, the criterion.

7
00:00:42.373 --> 00:00:51.028
Three red lines: it can be stopped, it can be appealed, and a non-AI equivalent service remains.

8
00:00:51.028 --> 00:01:01.035
Anyone can press the physical stop button at the Zero Switchback Kiosk without an app, an account or a network.

9
00:01:01.035 --> 00:01:05.453
The offline review page has a smart-layer toggle;

10
00:01:05.453 --> 00:01:15.280
switching it off shows, for each scenario card, how the same thing is done and who is responsible without AI.

11
00:01:15.280 --> 00:01:18.796
Part three, how the ten scenarios land.

12
00:01:18.796 --> 00:01:41.876
The ten scenarios cover open-source release, the safety-governance sandbox, edge compute, slow-traffic navigation, the international roadshow, the low-carbon corridor, achievement transfer, the data-element room, life services and the global AI week route.

13
00:01:41.876 --> 00:01:48.998
All ten cards are registered as machine-readable Switchback Protocol instances.

14
00:01:48.998 --> 00:01:56.751
In eighty rule checks, seventy injected defects were intercepted and zero were missed.

15
00:01:56.751 --> 00:02:00.448
Part four, the boundary of its authority.

16
00:02:00.448 --> 00:02:08.111
This is a concept suggestion and a reference scheme for professional teams to deepen.

17
00:02:08.111 --> 00:02:16.946
It is not a government decision, not an approval conclusion, and not an implementation commitment.

18
00:02:16.946 --> 00:02:30.019
Until official boundaries, regulatory plans, road red lines and ownership records are published, spatial conclusions stay provisional or unknown.

19
00:02:30.019 --> 00:02:35.608
The Jing-Zhang Railway taught the city how to reverse a train;

20
00:02:35.608 --> 00:02:44.173
the Symbiosis Belt asks every AI capability to register its reverse path before moving forward.
